/*
 * YmirArguments — command-line options for the Ymir compiler.
 *
 * This record stores all command-line flags and parameters passed to the
 * compiler frontend. These options control:
 *
 *   - input file selection,
 *   - include directories,
 *   - version flags,
 *   - debug mode,
 *   - dump modes(syntax/semantic/YIL),
 *   - disabling semantic validation,
 *   - disabling lint/expansion.
 *
 * The Parser reads these arguments once at startup and configures global
 * compiler state accordingly.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::args
 * @File: ymirc/args.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2025-01-04
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
